  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><a href=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbwo9XARh0C4-oG4VF2PgcFjpiUjqfggK19N8I2KGuZIrQMX0GdHI0B5dZH8fSz9v_zD/exec\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbwo9XARh0C4-oG4VF2PgcFjpiUjqfggK19N8I2KGuZIrQMX0GdHI0B5dZH8fSz9v_zD/exec</span></a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"알코올 증발 시뮬레이션\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"script.google.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbwo9XARh0C4-oG4VF2PgcFjpiUjqfggK19N8I2KGuZIrQMX0GdHI0B5dZH8fSz9v_zD/exec\" data-og-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbwo9XARh0C4-oG4VF2PgcFjpiUjqfggK19N8I2KGuZIrQMX0GdHI0B5dZH8fSz9v_zD/exec\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbwo9XARh0C4-oG4VF2PgcFjpiUjqfggK19N8I2KGuZIrQMX0GdHI0B5dZH8fSz9v_zD/exec\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbwo9XARh0C4-oG4VF2PgcFjpiUjqfggK19N8I2KGuZIrQMX0GdHI0B5dZH8fSz9v_zD/exec\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">알코올 증발 시뮬레이션</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">script.google.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">바이브 코딩으로 만든<br>구글 API키를 이용하여<br>제미나이가 연동되는 버전입니다<br><b>(이건 체험용입니다<br>실제 수업에서 활용하시려면<br>맨 아래쪽에 가시면 수업용 링크글이 있어요)</b></span><br><br><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">학생들이 답변한 것을 제미나이가 바로 피드백을 주는 형태로 업그레이드를 해보았습니다.</span><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">오른쪽 상단 &#39;학생 모드&#39;를 누르면</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1066e25dbd6f44244a8e64d2427609cd59455bd6\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1066e25dbd6f44244a8e64d2427609cd59455bd6\" data-origin-width=\"626\" data-origin-height=\"790\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">이렇게 형성평가가 나오는데</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">아래쪽 왼쪽에 AI채점이 있습니다.</span><br>&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">채점을 누르면 작성한 내용에 대해 제미나이가 채점을 합니다.</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/02baa3026d4205876b7c8ae55393325c5e6a6b5d\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"587\" height=\"1029\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/02baa3026d4205876b7c8ae55393325c5e6a6b5d\" data-origin-width=\"405\" data-origin-height=\"710\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><br><br><br>똑같은 답을 또 채점을 해봅니다.</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/daa08860f6cb9f66a8e34d8af0ceee14beee710e\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"571\" height=\"1037\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/daa08860f6cb9f66a8e34d8af0ceee14beee710e\" data-origin-width=\"419\" data-origin-height=\"761\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">다르게 피드백을 해줍니다.</span><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">이렇게 AI채점을 한뒤 시트로 제출하기 누르면</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">AI채점 한 내용도 시트로 받을 수 있으며</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">답변 다운로드 누르면&#160;</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">AI채점 한 내용도 함께 txt 파일로 저장됩니다.<br><br>구글시트로 학생들 답변 한꺼번에 받는 방법은 아래 링크글<br></span><a href=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/sayment/223931696350\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://m.blog.naver.com/sayment/223931696350</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"#증발 현상 #가상 #실험 (#시뮬레이션) #중1과학 ( TXT파일로 저장하기, 구글시트로 형성평가 작성\" data-og-description=\"https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbxstpPaUzxRfL243OkW2e8wiS_5mKOrcrjnjh6NYIIT...\" data-og-host=\"blog.naver.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/sayment/223931696350\" data-og-url=\"https://blog.naver.com/sayment/223931696350\" data-og-image=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/q44RY/bl4O5BAg3IM/PT3Kdjp6hixiRLaURKCSIK/kakaolink40_original.png?width=743&amp;height=853\"><a href=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/sayment/223931696350\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/sayment/223931696350\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/q44RY/bl4O5BAg3IM/PT3Kdjp6hixiRLaURKCSIK/kakaolink40_original.png?width=743&amp;height=853\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">#증발 현상 #가상 #실험 (#시뮬레이션) #중1과학 ( TXT파일로 저장하기, 구글시트로 형성평가 작성</p><p class=\"og-desc\">https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbxstpPaUzxRfL243OkW2e8wiS_5mKOrcrjnjh6NYIIT...</p><p class=\"og-host\">blog.naver.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">단, 아래와 같은 메시지가 종종 뜹니다<br>(보통은 잘 안뜰꺼에요)</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c0164aac29538dd7c5221b68fb691dda32dbb312\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"587\" height=\"57\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c0164aac29538dd7c5221b68fb691dda32dbb312\" data-origin-width=\"402\" data-origin-height=\"39\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">이런 에러는</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">제미나이의 API로 출력하는 것이 일시적으로(순간적으로) 많을때 <br>이 에러가 뜹니다.<br>시간을 가지시고 다시 눌러보시면 <br>AI피드백 결과가 나올겁니다^^</span><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">한두번정도만 테스트 해보시길</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">이것을 학생에 배포하면</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">제 API key 용량이 바닥이 날 수 있습니다.<br></span><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size23\">테스트 해보시고 괜찮으시면</span></span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size23\">맨 아래 쪽에 개인API활용하는 방법으로 활용해보세요&#160;</span></span></b><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">추가로</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">AI채점을 더 실행해보았습니다.</span><br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d857250a488c2342ed19d703781e30704bee919f\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"531\" height=\"958\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d857250a488c2342ed19d703781e30704bee919f\" data-origin-width=\"395\" data-origin-height=\"713\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">--------------------------------------------------------<br>&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">무료 개인 구글API 발급받는 방법부터~~ 내용을 담아서</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">개인 구글API 이용하여 활용하는 버전은<br>아래 링크글 클릭</span></span></b><br><a href=\"https://blog.naver.com/sayment/223936713552\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">https://blog.naver.com/sayment/223936713552</span></a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"증발 시뮬레이션 활용(#구글개인